<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-002" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:marriage" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:marriage:m0000" ref="591_360_8ca">樂令</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:marriage:m0002" ref="591_360_8ca_D">女</persName>適大將軍<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:marriage:m0007" ref="e81_f09_000">成都王頴</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:career" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:career:m0000" ref="591_360_8ca">樂廣</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:career:m0003" ref="591_360_8ca">彦輔</persName>，南陽人。淸夷沖曠，加有理識。累遷侍中、河南尹。在朝廷用心虚淡，時人重其貞貴，代<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:career:m0045" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>爲尚書令。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:accusation" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0000" ref="e81_f09_000">成都王</persName>之起兵，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0007" ref="4c6_984_9ed">長沙王</persName>猜<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0011" ref="591_360_8ca">廣</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0013" ref="591_360_8ca">廣</persName>曰：『寧以一女而易五男？』<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0027" ref="4c6_984_9ed">乂</persName>猶疑之，遂以憂卒。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:ending" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">由是釋然，無復疑慮。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:wei-identity" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:wei-identity:m0000" ref="412_2d3_654">玠</persName>穎識通達，天韻標令，陳郡謝幼輿敬以亞父之禮。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:wei-marriage" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note">娶<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:wei-marriage:m0001" ref="591_360_8ca">樂廣</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-leguang:wei-marriage:m0003" ref="591_360_8ca_E">女</persName>。</p>
</text>
